{"t": 1792714153287, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "f_refused", "#349 check: pressing F inside Newburg's land (3m from its well, tick ~4450) refuses with 'This land is claimed by Newburg. Found your settlement outside its borders. Open ground lies about 250 to the north.' Distance and direction ARE given (good). But: no unit on '250', and nothing on screen shows which way is north (no compass, no minimap, no heading in HUD), so the direction is hard to act on. The status toast also overlaps the 'Town of Newburg' label."]}
