{"t": 1792714240820, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "founded", "Settlement founded at tick 6450 by following the refusal hint ('250 to the north') - the #349 hint worked. But the success toast leads with 'You are back on your own land.' rather than 'You founded Eastford', and the big floating settlement label ('Camp ... 1/8 residents') sits behind the toast/Chronicle panels and is unreadable. Also AI nations founded ~7 settlements in the first 2 game-minutes; a newcomer's first two F presses were refused because AIs had grabbed the land."]}
